Names
-----

PM-KUSUM, Jal Jeevan Mission (JJM) and eJalShakti are names of schemes
and services of the Government of India (the Ministry of New and
Renewable Energy and the Ministry of Jal Shakti, Department of Drinking
Water and Sanitation). KPMG, MAHADISCOM, SECI, OREDA, EESL and NIC are named
only as authors or publishers of the documents followed. The names are used only
to say which messages this module handles. This module is not made,
endorsed or supported by any ministry, agency, utility or company, and
is not affiliated with them.

Government documents
--------------------

No text of the documents is reproduced. Topic structures, keywords,
parameter codes, units, error codes and API member names are interface
facts, described in our own words. The documents are not redistributed.
PROVENANCE.md lists each with its date. No sample message printed in the
documents is included: test messages are our own, built to the same
layouts with made-up values.

Facts from other projects
-------------------------

Two public GitHub repositories without a licence were read for facts
only (topic and keyword forms used in the field); nothing of them is
copied, and the tests use our own values: github.com/Chetan1909/EC200_Display
(RMS firmware) and github.com/YashGajjar7017/Api_Fetcher_PYTHON (field
captures).

